# Add a project, then items, through the overlays. A flash holds the hints back, so a
# wait after a create names the row and the panes, not the hints.
wait Export posts from the old CMS

press a
wait Enter project name
frame project-prompt
type Repaint the fence
wait Repaint the fence
frame project-prompt-typed
press enter
wait /Repaint the fence +○0 ✓0/
frame project-added

press G
wait No items
press l
wait /(?m)^╭.*┏/
press a
wait Enter item title
frame item-prompt
type Scrape and prime the boards
press enter
wait ○ Scrape and prime the boards
frame item-added

press A
wait New item (multi-project)
type Buy exterior paint
press enter
wait Projects for new item
frame project-picker
press j
wait > [ ] Replace the kitchen faucet
press space
wait > [x] Replace the kitchen faucet
frame project-picker-toggled
press enter
wait ○ Buy exterior paint
frame item-in-two-projects

press a
wait Enter item title
press esc
gone Enter item title

press q
exits
